@everyone New Exclusive Campaign!
When: Thursdays 6:30-8:30 from March 4th - May 27th

Hello fellow DMs and Mods. Empire City is less than 5 months away, if you can believe it. And there is still a lot of work to be done. With so many DM’s this season, it’s important for us to keep talking. That’s why I’m running a short preparatory campaign from March through the end of May. This will give many of us the excuse we need to actually meet together and interact with each other. I’ll cover the rules of the game below, but the whole point of this game is to get us GM’s talking. The game is open to all the GMs and mods participating in Empire City. It’s a weekly game every Thursday evening from 6:30 - 8:30 PM PST. After each gaming session, I hope you will continue talking with each other, and write your stories and NPCs together for Empire City.
